    {
      "type": "function",
      "function": {
        "name": "greet",
        "description": "Greets a person by name and returns a greeting string.",
        "parameters": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "name": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "The name of the person to greet."
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "name"
          ],
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

Also keeping the output format, but not providing any tools also works:

```json
{
